{"title":"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems\">2005 AMC 12B #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems\">2005 AMC 10B #6</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At the beginning of the school year, Lisa's goal was to earn an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> on at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> quizzes for the year.  She earned an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> quizzes.  If she is to achieve her goal, on at most how many of the remaining quizzes can she earn a grade lower than an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b29396993e55c4496f2b9acf510f9191ebaefaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\ 1      \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\ 2      \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\ 3      \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\ 4      \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"383\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Lisa's goal was to get an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24f5c3320e5a1ab3453ae60518e8bb9520d29b6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\% \\cdot 50 = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"14\" /> quizzes.  She already has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />'s on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> quizzes, so she needs to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />'s on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55c4beb7cb06f4d07e8205a8870c33deab24c5fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40-22=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> more.  There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d1fcc71445d5dd7e5699c1fb03b3beb4a7ffbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50-30=20$\" width=\"100\" height=\"12\" /> quizzes left, so she can afford to get less than an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/6/e16c5dc1a1e26ca2af8eddbc78abe2372d37c118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20-18=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" /> of them.\n</p><p>Here, only the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />'s matter... No complicated stuff!\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B\">2005 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" c